# Spotify — powers the "now playing" tile.
#
# 1. Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard and copy the
#    client ID and secret into the two variables below.
# 2. Add http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback to the app's Redirect URIs.
#    (Spotify rejects the hostname `localhost`; it must be the IP literal.)
# 3. Run `npm run spotify:token` and paste the result into the third variable.
#
# Refresh tokens do not expire, so step 3 is only needed once — or again if the
# token is revoked or the client secret is rotated.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
SPOTIFY_REFRESH_TOKEN=
